{"created": "2025-08-15T13:02:54.620736+00:00", "modified": "2025-08-27T04:08:10.677302+00:00", "id": 16882077, "conceptrecid": "16882076", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.16882076", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "metadata": {"title": "NEU-DET-and-GC10-DET-with-YOLO-fromat", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "publication_date": "2025-08-15", "description": "<p>The raw data of this dataset originates from NEU-DET (K. Song and Y. Yan, &ldquo;A noise robust method based on completed local binary patterns for hot-rolled steel strip surface defects,&rdquo; Applied Surface Science, vol. 285, pp. 858-864, Nov. 2013) and GC10-DET (Lv, X.; Duan, F.; Jiang, J.-j.; Fu, X. and Gan, L. &ldquo;Deep Metallic Surface Defect Detection: The New Benchmark and Detection Network.&rdquo; Sensors 2020, 20, 1562.).</p>\n<p>The following preprocessing steps were applied to the original data in this dataset:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Format conversion: The data formats of both NEU-DET and GC10-DET were converted into YOLO format.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Noise addition: Random noise at 15 dB to 30 dB was added to the images of both NEU-DET and GC10-DET.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Data splitting: The data in both NEU-DET and GC10-DET were divided into training and validation sets in an 8:2 ratio.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "guan, li", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "16882076"}}]}}, "title": "NEU-DET-and-GC10-DET-with-YOLO-fromat", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16882077", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16882077?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16882077", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882076", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16882076", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.16882076", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.16882076", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16882077/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:16882077/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/16882077/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/requests"}, "updated": "2025-08-27T04:08:10.677302+00:00", "recid": "16882077", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "8a8e364e-bb12-45a8-9196-0b1327dbdce6", "key": "GC10-DET.zip", "size": 962293015, "checksum": "md5:f1b760523f7497474b45dc5fc6020432", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/files/GC10-DET.zip/content"}}, {"id": "d94039e6-6570-49ab-9f30-0677aa4f50d6", "key": "NEU-DET.zip", "size": 27428830, "checksum": "md5:a62818cfdd92e617890e546ab40945ea", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/16882077/files/NEU-DET.zip/content"}}], "swh": {}, "owners": [{"id": "1379645"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 332, "unique_downloads": 232, "views": 380, "unique_views": 348, "version_downloads": 332, "version_unique_downloads": 232, "version_unique_views": 348, "version_views": 380}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}